<title>GERMANY: Lufthansa H1 gp pretax profit down 37 pct.</title>
<headline>Lufthansa H1 gp pretax profit down 37 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30 (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     119	vs 189</p>
<p>    Group sales				  9,800    up 6.6 pct</p>
<p>    Spending on materials	  more than 4,300   up 8 pct</p>
<p>    Passenger numbers		   19.7 million   up 0.4 pct</p>
<p>    Freight and mail volume	   808,600 tonnes up 2.8 pct</p>
<p>    Staff				    58,852	  up 2.5 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Deutsche Lufthansa AG. The airline said the main reasons for the drop in profit were the fire in April at Duesseldorf airport, over-capacity and price-slashing by competitors.  </p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
